{"id":"07f5930ce42abb03","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-maclane-coherence.md","title":"Mac Lane Coherence Theorem","display":"Mac Lane Coherence Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-maclane-coherence","aliases":["93-thm-maclane-coherence"],"display":"Mac Lane Coherence Theorem","depends_on":["[[93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-maclane-coherence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-maclane-coherence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Mac Lane Coherence Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97a6f341b7a6e48c\" href=\"?note=97a6f341b7a6e48c\" title=\"93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism\">93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-maclane-coherence-—-Mac-Lane-Coherence-Theorem\">thm-maclane-coherence — Mac Lane Coherence Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}\">\\(\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}\\)</span> is the exact monoidal-category predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f2bb87045d6238a\" href=\"?note=0f2bb87045d6238a\" title=\"93-df-monoidal-category\">93-df-monoidal-category</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\\)</span> is the least canonical-morphism relation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97a6f341b7a6e48c\" href=\"?note=97a6f341b7a6e48c\" title=\"93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism\">93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span> 的生成过程具有同一对形式源、靶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>，分别解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span>；该条件由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97a6f341b7a6e48c\" href=\"?note=97a6f341b7a6e48c\" title=\"93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism\">93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}\\)</span> 表达。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n{}&amp;\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(g,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(s)=X\n\\land\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(t)=Y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(f,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(g,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to f=g.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n{}&amp;\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(g,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(s)=X\n\\land\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(t)=Y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(f,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(g,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to f=g.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仅有旧 Can₉₃(f,X,Y) 与 Can₉₃(g,X,Y) 不足以推出相等，因为不同形式表达式可能解释成同一对象。这里不改变 Can₉₃ 的意义，只补入形式源靶一致的条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-maclane-coherence-—-Mac-Lane-Coherence-Theorem","text":"thm-maclane-coherence — Mac Lane Coherence Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"97a6f341b7a6e48c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-monoidal-category","status":"resolved","id":"0f2bb87045d6238a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}$ is the exact monoidal-category predicate of [[93-df-monoidal-category]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"97a6f341b7a6e48c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)$ is the least canonical-morphism relation of [[93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"97a6f341b7a6e48c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g$ 的生成过程具有同一对形式源、靶 $s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$，分别解释为 $X,Y$；该条件由 [[93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism]] 的 $\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}$ 表达。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"f,g","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n{}&\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(g,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists s,t\\in\\operatorname{FObj}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(s)=X\n\\land\\operatorname{FEval}_{93}(\\mathfrak M)(t)=Y\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}\\land\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(f,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\n\\land\\mathrm{SynCan}_{93}(g,s,t;\\mathfrak M)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\to f=g.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1612,"backlinks":[{"id":"703de0dbb1e0c2b6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"This is the finite-limit/stable-image notion of a coherent category. It is distinct from Mac Lane's coherence theorem for associators and unitors in [[93-thm-maclane-coherence]]."}],"outgoing":["97a6f341b7a6e48c","0f2bb87045d6238a"]}